OL,3,GNEWSAFour US Chinooks stop off at
OL,4,ALand's End airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour US army Chinook helicopters made a
OL,7,Fquick stop off at one of the UK's
OL,8,Fsmallest commercial airports.
OL,10,FThe tandem rotor military helicopters
OL,11,Flanded at Land's End Airport, Cornwall
OL,12,Fon Tuesday to refuel, before heading on
OL,13,Fto the Channel Islands.
OL,15,FThe Isles of Scilly Steamship Group,
OL,16,Fwhich owns and operates the airport,
OL,17,Fsaid it believed the helicopters were
OL,18,Fpart of US President Donald Trump's two
OL,19,Fday visit to Ireland, and were en route
OL,20,Fto Jersey.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
