OL,3,GNEWSAFour US Chinooks stop off at
OL,4,ALand's End airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Pearson, manager of Land's End
OL,7,FAirport, said it was an "incredible
OL,8,Fsight" as it had "never happened before
OL,9,Fand I can't imagine it will happen
OL,10,Fagain."
